  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://jipmer.edu.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Jawaharlal Institute of Postgraduate Medical Education and Research (JIPMER)</a> </span>has released the Notification for the recruitment of JIPMER Exam 2026. This recruitment has been issued for 34 posts. Applications for the JIPMER Group A Non-Faculty Recruitment 2026 has Started from 12 June 2026, &amp; Candidate can apply till 01 July 2026. &nbsp;Candidates must check the complete details for JIPMER Group A Non-Faculty Recruitment 2026 which has given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Jawaharlal Institute of Postgraduate Medical Education and Research (JIPMER)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">JIPMER Group A Non-Faculty Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">JIPMER Advt No. :&nbsp;</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>12 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>01 July 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>01 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>15 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Available : <strong>Available Soon</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 1500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, <strong>: Rs. 1200/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PH Candidate : <strong>Rs. 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>JIPMER Group A Non-Faculty Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>Post Wise</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>Post Wise</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per JIPMER Group A Non-Faculty Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool –</span> </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>JIPMER Group A Non-Faculty 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 34 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name / Campus</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General Duty Medical Officer</span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(Yanam)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">19</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General Duty Medical Officer</span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(Karaikal)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">05</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General Duty Medical Officer</span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(Puducherry)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Child Psychologist</span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(Puducherry)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Specialist Grade-II (Junior Scale)</span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>(Yanam)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">08</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>JIPMER Group A Non-Faculty 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 38.2491%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name / Campus</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.7509%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Qualification</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 38.2491%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General Duty Medical Officer <strong>(Yanam)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.7509%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have an <strong>MBBS degree</strong> from a recognized university along with at least <strong>3 years of experience</strong> after completing the compulsory internship. For detailed eligibility criteria, candidates are advised to read the official notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 38.2491%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General Duty Medical Officer <strong>(Karaikal)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.7509%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-turn-id-container=\"43da3022-5b66-413e-a9dc-3ac534e6d06f\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: inherit; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have an <strong>MBBS degree</strong> from a recognized university and a minimum of <strong>3 years of experience</strong> after completion of the compulsory internship. For detailed eligibility criteria, candidates are advised to refer to the official notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 38.2491%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General Duty Medical Officer <strong>(Puducherry)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.7509%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have an <strong>MBBS degree</strong> from a recognized university and at least <strong>3 years of post-internship experience</strong>. For complete eligibility details, candidates should refer to the official notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 38.2491%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Child Psychologist <strong>(Puducherry)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.7509%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-turn-id-container=\"e2e8af80-f039-4209-b5ea-f32eeb7ab132\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: inherit; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have an <strong>M.Phil. in Clinical Psychology</strong> or an equivalent qualification, along with a minimum of 2 years of experience in Child and Adolescent Mental Health. Valid registration with the Rehabilitation Council of India (RCI) is mandatory. For complete eligibility details, candidates should refer to the official notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 38.2491%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Specialist Grade-II (Junior Scale) <strong>(Yanam)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.7509%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have an <strong>MBBS degree</strong> from a recognized university along with the relevant<strong> MD/MS/DM qualification</strong> in the concerned specialty. Candidates should also possess the required post-qualification experience as prescribed for the respective specialty. For complete eligibility details, refer to the official notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Apply JIPMER Group A Non-Faculty Online Form 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://jipmer.edu.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the PSPCL before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other&nbsp;&nbsp;Notification Here –&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for JIPMER Group A Non-Faculty recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>JIPMER Group A Non-Faculty Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: cen